 biståndsbudget, från cirka 59 procent till cirka 67 procent mellan 2019 och 2020, och det är viktigt att riksdagen får regelbunden information om resultat som uppnåtts genom sådan assistans.", "en": "Multilateral aid has increased significantly as a share of Sweden's aid budget, from approximately 59 percent to 67 percent between 2019 and 2020, and it is important that parliament receives regular information on results achieved through such assistance."}, "subtopics": ["utvecklingssamarbete", "multilateralt bistånd", "fn-bistånd"], "parties_involved": ["C", "MP"]}}